{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"bill-maher","name":"Bill Maher","birthDate":"1956-01-20","birthPlace":"New York City, New York, USA","bio":"William 'Bill' Maher, Jr. is an American stand-up comedian, television host, political commentator, author and actor. Before his current role as the host of HBO's Real Time with Bill Maher, he hosted a similar late-night talk show called Politically Incorrect, originally on Comedy Central and later on ABC. He's known for his political satire and sociopolitical commentary, which targets a wide swath of topics. He supports the legalization of marijuana and same-sex marriage, and serves on the board of PETA. He is also a critic of religion and is an advisory board member of Project Reason, a foundation to promote scientific knowledge and secular values within society. He currently ranks number 38 on Comedy Central's 100 greatest stand-ups of all time. He got a Hollywood Walk of Fame star on September 14, 2010.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:36:05+00:00","tmdbId":74086,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/74086","credits":[{"id":"iron-man-3","title":"Iron Man 3","character":"Bill Maher","characterFa":"بیل ماهر"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/bill-maher.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Once Upon a Time in Jersey","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9pqGbaAMUJUQVQvDZU3uNdVTve4.jpg"},{"name":"Bill Maher: Is Anyone Else Seeing This?","year":2025,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wa7MdHEzHxwMqXy2bPA5pD5VDVY.jpg"},{"name":"Hollywood Squares","year":2025,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ndaQ2k2iTz4Gp29OKEnsJk9L8b9.jpg"},{"name":"Reality","year":2023,"character":"Self (archive footage)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rTEYxSDo9aJTTbM0zuMMLgzJcUJ.jpg"},{"name":"TMZ's Merry Elfin' Christmas","year":2023,"character":"Self","mediaType":"movie","post